  "notes": "Image titled LILYGO T-Display RP2040 (IPS ST7789V 1.14 inch). Board silkscreen is partly hidden under the display; only clearly visible differing spellings (G) added. The note 'Battery voltage ADC detection IO26' is printed beside the 5V callout but describes an internal signal, so it is not added to the 5V pin. Skipped: ST7789V display assignments (MOSI GP3, SCLK GP2, CS GP5, DC GP1, RST GP0, BL GP4), buttons GPIO6/GPIO7/BOOT, RUN/Enable switch, IO25 red LED."
